PART 2 — Construct the Persona → Process → System Hierarchy

The target architecture should conceptually be:

Role AI Agent / Persona
↓
Process AI Agents
↓
System AI Agents

A Role AI Agent should represent the business persona/orchestrator.

Process AI Agents should represent the business processes/capabilities performed for that persona.

System AI Agents should represent the underlying system-level capabilities/services/tools used by the process agents.

For every Role AI Agent, determine exactly which Process AI Agents and System AI Agents should participate in its workflow based on the Excel.

Do not simply copy relationships from one column to another.

Use the agent’s:

* Purpose
* Functionality
* Inputs
* Outputs
* Requirements
* Dependencies
* Business responsibilities

to determine the logical flow.

