PART 7 — Design the New Role AI Agent Layer

The existing codebase does not currently have Role AI Agents/personas.

Therefore, design the new Role AI Agent layer on top of the existing capabilities.

Do NOT unnecessarily redesign the existing Process/System agents.

The preferred architecture should be:

                Role AI Agent
                     │
      ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
      ↓              ↓              ↓
Process Agent   Process Agent   Process Agent
      │              │              │
      ↓              ↓              ↓
System Agent    System Agent    System Agent
                     │
              Existing Codebase
              / Reusable Agents

The Role AI Agent should primarily provide:

* Persona-specific context
* Business objective
* Task understanding
* Process selection
* Process orchestration
* Context/state management
* Decision making
* Handoff between process agents
* Final response/decision

Reuse existing Process/System capabilities wherever practical.

