CRITICAL EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS

Before producing the final Excel:

1. Inspect the entire Excel workbook, including every relevant sheet.
2. Inspect the entire existing codebase, not just a few obvious files.
3. Build an internal inventory of all Excel agents.
4. Build an internal inventory of all existing codebase capabilities.
5. Perform semantic/functional matching between them.
